# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# WHAT:      Tells Git which files and directories to ignore entirely.
# WHY:       Keeps secrets, compiled code, and local OS trash out of the public repository.
# BUSINESS:  Prevents intellectual property loss and security breaches.
# ENGINEER:  This file is a security boundary. Every line prevents a category of mistake. Never add exceptions without understanding the consequence.
# RECRUITER: Demonstrates awareness of cross-stack dependencies (Node, Python, Terraform, K8s).
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Secrets & Credentials
.env
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
*.p12
.secrets.baseline

# Terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfvars
crash.log

# Ansible
*.retry
vault_pass.txt
*.vault

# Kubernetes
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

# Python
pycache/
.pyc
.venv/

# Node
node_modules/
.npm/

# OS & IDE
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
